import { urls } from "../../../../data";
<div id="navigation-menu-overview">
  <component-banner-img/>

  <p>
    A navigation menu <em>looks</em> like a
    <a href=`${urls.components}/menu`>menu</a> , but is actually a list of links
    to other pages. It is a navigational widget, rather than a dynamic
    user-interface control.
  </p>
  <p>
    If selecting an item requires a full page load (i.e. acting like a link),
    use a navigation menu instead of the
    <a href=`${urls.components}/menu`>menu</a> component, which is for commands
    that run JavaScript without leaving the page.
  </p>
  <p>
    The <code>fake-menu</code> class is deprecated and will be removed in the
    next major version of Skin. Use <code>navigation-menu</code> instead.
  </p>
</div>
